{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43331","headline":"河中献捷 · 张随","name":"河中献捷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叛将忘恩久，王师不战通。\n凯歌千里内，喜气二仪中。\n寇尽条山下，兵回汉苑东。\n将军初执讯，明主欲论功。\n落日烟尘静，寒郊壁垒空。\n苍生幸无事，自此乐尧风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张随","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}